3. DNA3.0-2B / DNA3.0-4B — translation + summary/Q&A language models
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Component : DNA3.0-2B and DNA3.0-4B (dnotitia) — Korean-focused post-trainings
               of Qwen3.5-2B and Qwen3.5-4B. The app uses one of them, chosen by
               installed memory (2B on 8 GB Macs, 4B on 16 GB and up).
   Used in   : on-device live translation + post-session summary / Q&A, run by the
               bundled sovereign Metal LLM engines
               (Contents/MacOS/translate-engine-2b, translate-engine-4b)
   Source    : https://huggingface.co/dnotitia/DNA3.0-2B
               https://huggingface.co/dnotitia/DNA3.0-4B
               Base models: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B and
               https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B (Apache-2.0)
               Downloaded as the i1-Q4_K_M GGUF quants:
               https://huggingface.co/mradermacher/DNA3.0-2B-i1-GGUF
               https://huggingface.co/mradermacher/DNA3.0-4B-i1-GGUF
   Copyright : Copyright (c) Dnotitia Inc.; base models (c) Alibaba Cloud (Qwen)
   License   : Apache License, Version 2.0  (see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md §A)
   Changes   : Weights format-converted to Q4_K_M GGUF quants; inference runs on an
               independent Zig/Metal engine. No change to architecture or weights.
   Note      : NOT bundled in the app/DMG — the selected model is downloaded on
               demand (~1.3 GB for 2B, ~2.8 GB for 4B) when the user turns on
               translation.

